sequenceDiagram
  participant H as shared history
  participant A as agent A — incident scope
  participant B as agent B — change scope
  participant C as agent C — incident scope
  activate A
  A->>H: read incident context
  H-->>A: goals, evidence, decisions
  activate B
  B->>H: read change context
  H-->>B: constraints, prior findings
  A->>H: record findings + open work
  deactivate A
  B->>H: record change evidence
  activate C
  C->>H: join scope, read open work
  H-->>C: findings, evidence, obligations
  C->>H: record next-step decision
  deactivate B
  C->>H: record outcome + remaining work
  deactivate C
